    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eMultiply by 100 to convert to a percent.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e0.2 is approximately 0.627% of 31.9.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-9 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_9_50/f-50-9-5.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003ec\u003c/b\u003e. Write out the percent equation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003ec\u003c/b\u003e. Write out the percent equation.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"91\" height\u003d\"41\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_9_50/image016.gif\" class\u003d\"middle\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
